# Unit Traceability System - MkFF LASERTEKNIQUE

The **Unit Traceability System** is a web-based platform designed to monitor and manage the status of various manufacturing or assembly stations in real-time. This tool is used by Admins and Operators to ensure effective workflow visibility and unit tracking across multiple stations.

---

## Login Roles

- **Admin**  
  Accesses an overview of all stations. Can monitor status (Active/Offline) of each station.

- **Operator**  
  Intended for operational level access (future development or limited view).

---

## Features

- Secure login screen with role-based access
- Dashboard for Admin showing:
  - **15 stations**, each with a status indicator
  - Status can be: `Active` (green) or `Offline` (gray)
- Responsive and user-friendly UI
- Logout functionality for session control

---

## Technologies Used

- **HTML5**  
- **CSS3** (with custom styling and responsive design)
- **JavaScript** (for UI logic and navigation)
- Currently runs on **Vercel (localhost)** for development/testing

---

## Pages

- `index.html` – Login page with role selection dropdown
- `admin-dashboard.html` – Admin view with all station tiles and their statuses

---


